{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big判Y：Y的大块本身包含人物处境、原因和转折，X放大的不少只是“笃定没撑多久”“舍不得什么”这样的词组，单看大字不够自足；small判Y：Y把体验补充和音乐旁注分开，胸口发紧、整理衣服、回望等细节能补出具体体验，且不读不影响主线。core判平：两版都持续呈现不愿再受委屈与怀念被当作自己人的日子之间的拉扯，结尾也都落在带着想念继续生活；concise判X：Y在S04反复使用“越鲜活”，S05又出现“不肯因此算了”和“不能就这么算了”的近义重复，X整体推进更省。human判X：Y有“心里一阵阵冲上去又退下来”“那段曾被当作自己人的日子”“心脏以最高负荷”等具体搭配或语义问题；fine判X：“外头像给众人看的舞步，心里却只哼自己的旧歌”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”等表达更有辨识度；load判X：X每屏放大的短语虽然略多，但长度较短、意群清楚，Y整句大块的文字总量更大，尤其S13，扫读负担更高。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "da23df3e-f47a-4c89-8a94-28aab0068c8b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T051916254157Z", "elapsed_seconds": 209.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T05:22:45.532891+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73b87d3534888cd452da6d0e4b14bde82f158e90dbdcfb14d4708caa78e09ab7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4c